  "description": "A grant with an empty p and an empty x, as an exchange message that is not part of a transaction must carry (KERI lines 975 and 979), signed by the issuer's current key. A validator should accept it (liveness, inferred). It is the positive pair of the single-message refusals KERI-0069, KERI-0070, KERI-0071, KERI-0075 and KERI-0076, each of which differs from it only in its defect.",
